      "content": "It sounds like you're experiencing a deep sense of exhaustion and meaninglessness, which can feel incredibly overwhelming. Please know that these feelings are a sign that you need a break, not that you are a failure. If you are struggling with these thoughts, reaching out to a mental health professional can provide you with the support and tools to navigate these difficult emotions. You don't have to carry this weight alone.",
